{"parse":{"title":"铃兰之剑×核聚变游戏节：北京站参展确认！","pageid":3067,"revid":6603,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%C3%97%E6%A0%B8%E8%81%9A%E5%8F%98%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E8%8A%82%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E7%AB%99%E5%8F%82%E5%B1%95%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%81&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%C3%97%E6%A0%B8%E8%81%9A%E5%8F%98%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E8%8A%82%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E7%AB%99%E5%8F%82%E5%B1%95%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%81&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%C3%97%E6%A0%B8%E8%81%9A%E5%8F%98%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E8%8A%82%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E7%AB%99%E5%8F%82%E5%B1%95%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%81&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E7%A7%91%E6%99%AE\" title=\"科普\">科普</a> &gt; <b>铃兰之剑×核聚变游戏节：北京站参展确认！</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E9.93.83.E5.85.B0.E4.B9.8B.E5.89.91.C3.97.E6.A0.B8.E8.81.9A.E5.8F.98.E6.B8.B8.E6.88.8F.E8.8A.82-.E5.8C.97.E4.BA.AC.E7.AB.99_.E5.8F.82.E5.B1.95.E7.A1.AE.E8.AE.A4.EF.BC.81\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"铃兰之剑×核聚变游戏节-北京站_参展确认！\">铃兰之剑×核聚变游戏节-北京站 参展确认！</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%C3%97%E6%A0%B8%E8%81%9A%E5%8F%98%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E8%8A%82%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E7%AB%99%E5%8F%82%E5%B1%95%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%EF%BC%81&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：铃兰之剑×核聚变游戏节-北京站 参展确认！\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：有版号的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-08-16 15:30<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2F05gX39_as7UNA3eaBnbTDw\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/05gX39_as7UNA3eaBnbTDw</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息163.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/70/tdlqgkcmjeeht9l4vud7m6qcex8vna7.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"120\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p>最近佣兵团四处在传有<font color=\"brown\"><b>大事发生</b></font><br />\n小场记特地拜托勇敢的<font color=\"brown\"><b>法卡尔</b></font>一探究竟<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息164.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/82/jwyokfvx9ta1yujeh31plreqx6aopti.png/150px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF164.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"154\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/82/jwyokfvx9ta1yujeh31plreqx6aopti.png/225px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF164.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/82/jwyokfvx9ta1yujeh31plreqx6aopti.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"267\" data-file-height=\"274\" /><br /><br />\n原来...<br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>《铃兰之剑》确认参展北京站2023核聚变啦！</b></font>\n<img alt=\"官方消息160.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e1/a7vq7wb84pph4k1n5zfz0sueqlv2kyz.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"100\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n</p>\n<table style=\"width:90%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>To：各位团长<br /><br />\n<p>感谢大家对《铃兰之剑》一直以来的支持与喜爱！在广州站核聚变之后，终于又有机会可以和各位见面啦！<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>◆展台地点◆<br />北京亦创国际会展中心 A8展位<br /><br />◆参展时间◆<br />2023年9月9日-9月10日</b></font></center>\n<p><br />\n本次线下我们准备了<b>《铃兰之剑》游戏试玩</b>以及<b>丰富的周边福利</b>！只要预约游戏，就可获得像素立牌周边，试玩还可以额外获得游戏角色大立牌哦~小场记已经迫不及待和团长见面啦！\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息165.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0b/0bv2t3dvwp13vhvhsnzv453m80beppv.png/500px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF165.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"889\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0b/0bv2t3dvwp13vhvhsnzv453m80beppv.png/750px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF165.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0b/0bv2t3dvwp13vhvhsnzv453m80beppv.png/1000px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF165.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1920\" /><img alt=\"官方消息162.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d6/svw1kgm80z16l73m4cyr5qbzzppqu7h.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"100\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n更多有趣的<font color=\"brown\"><b>惊喜活动</b></font><br />\n期待团长在<font color=\"brown\"><b>核聚变游戏节-北京站</b></font>亲自体验<br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>《铃兰之剑》</b></font>与您不见不散！\n</p>\n</center>\n<p><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息138.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b0/pdkoq2bc59leqjtmh9hij43e1io77b3.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1078\" height=\"490\" data-file-width=\"1078\" data-file-height=\"490\" />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021180727\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visi